<h3>CASPAR classification criteria</h3>
<p>Entry criterion（進入條件）：<strong>inflammatory articular disease of the joints, spine, or entheses</strong>（關節、脊椎或附著點的發炎性疾病）。<span class="ex-ref">p.1128</span></p>
