<tbody>
<tr><td><mark data-q="104-22,115-15">1. Psoriasis（三者互斥，只取一項）：current psoriasis</mark></td><td><mark data-q="115-15"><strong class="ex-n">2</strong></mark></td></tr>
<tr><td>　Personal history of psoriasis</td><td><strong class="ex-n">1</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="104-22">　Family history（first- or second-degree relative，一等或二等親）</mark></td><td><strong class="ex-n">1</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="104-22,115-15">2. Nail dystrophy typical of psoriasis（onycholysis、pitting、hyperkeratosis），must be current</mark></td><td><strong class="ex-n">1</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="104-22,115-15">3. Negative rheumatoid factor（any method except latex）</mark></td><td><strong class="ex-n">1</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="115-15">4. Dactylitis（current，或由風濕科醫師記錄的過去病史）</mark></td><td><strong class="ex-n">1</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="104-22">5. Juxtaarticular new bone formation（關節邊緣不明確骨化，不含 osteophytes），plain hand/feet radiographs</mark></td><td><strong class="ex-n">1</strong></td></tr>
